    {
      "id": "muu1w081xbmpor",
      "name": "mob",
      "type": "asr",
      "track_role": "streamer",
      "scope": "output",
      "page": "",
      "video": "clip",
      "preview_visible": false,
      "events": [
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081tcq46e",
          "start": 2.12,
          "end": 3.88,
          "text": "Holy moly. Alright, here we go.",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081d2ij86",
          "start": 4.68,
          "end": 9.84,
          "text": "Aboard the vessel of the welcome moon distant memories of the distant past.",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081hrbknb",
          "start": 16.84,
          "end": 19.64,
          "text": "Oh dear. Past few years? Holy...",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081mg24c2",
          "start": 29.56,
          "end": 33.32,
          "text": "Yeah, Zabai, get to work, okay? I gotta go play with these humans, alright?",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081egvjta",
          "start": 43.16,
          "end": 49.16,
          "text": "God damn. Yeah, Zabai and Thoth are pissed off. They're like, \"Man, why are they giving me all this extra work for?\"",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081q1vbou",
          "start": 51.32,
          "end": 56.16,
          "text": "\"You've taken a shine to our new master?\" Yeah, the Heavenly Principals is in charge, buddy.",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w08120owwk",
          "start": 64.56,
          "end": 65.68,
          "text": "Ooh.",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081gd9z9y",
          "start": 66.88,
          "end": 68.59,
          "text": "I wonder what festival that was?",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081ulmsxq",
          "start": 70.31,
          "end": 70.84,
          "text": "Lanternite?",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081lawx0d",
          "start": 76.16,
          "end": 77.52,
          "text": "High priest?",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w0817nb4f1",
          "start": 80.95,
          "end": 82.08,
          "text": "Uh...",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081lwrtn8",
          "start": 83.56,
          "end": 86.88,
          "text": "High priest? Is that, um, is that Hyperborea?",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081cht7ez",
          "start": 87.4,
          "end": 89.32,
          "text": "A Hyperborean festival?",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w0813we2dn",
          "start": 90.4,
          "end": 94.56,
          "text": "I'm thinking, I'm wondering if that's like the exalted saint, right? The Voyager?",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081uxyjhf",
          "start": 104.64,
          "end": 105.48,
          "text": "Oh, that's funny.",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081ikugwf",
          "start": 108.6,
          "end": 109.88,
          "text": "Holy moly.",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081jn76gi",
          "start": 110.68,
          "end": 113.64,
          "text": "Dancing in front of one of your own statues.",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w0816jy1wq",
          "start": 116.12,
          "end": 117.88,
          "text": "I love how playful Aria is.",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081pwlcfx",
          "start": 119.72,
          "end": 120.22,
          "text": "Uh!",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081215piz",
          "start": 120.6,
          "end": 121.2,
          "text": "Sonnet!",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081l2e1up",
          "start": 129.36,
          "end": 134.28,
          "text": "That's, that's, that's, I don't know if anyone realized, that's a SpongeBob moment right there. Yeah, it's like SpongeBob.",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081farss9",
          "start": 140.96,
          "end": 141.63,
          "text": "Oh my god.",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w0816rso76",
          "start": 145.68,
          "end": 152.19,
          "text": "\"Since the new moon envoy doesn't mind helping Sa-\" Oh, it was Zabai, actually.",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081cz54u5",
          "start": 153.19,
          "end": 157.88,
          "text": "Zabai's just the first moon envoy that came to mind when I said that. I didn't know it was actually Zabai.",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081isvw69",
          "start": 157.96,
          "end": 159.63,
          "text": "I mean, Zabai is, uh...",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w08162cnga",
          "start": 160.16,
          "end": 167.6,
          "text": "She loves, like, learning and like, math and studies and stuff like that, so I wonder if she wouldn't mind, actually.",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081ijf3jf",
          "start": 180.16,
          "end": 184.2,
          "text": "Oh, oh, the chariot? It's like, yo, we gotta baton pass every 30 days.",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w08189o0b3",
          "start": 184.48,
          "end": 185.36,
          "text": "Also, chat!",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081hfse7y",
          "start": 186.76,
          "end": 187.96,
          "text": "They spelled Zabai wrong.",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081a7ma7h",
          "start": 189.56,
          "end": 192.44,
          "text": "They put Z-B-A-I.",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081z8i1cx",
          "start": 194.44,
          "end": 199.52,
          "text": "\"Hoyoverse, I expect 1,600 Apollo gems for breaking my immersion, alright?",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081xls1x8",
          "start": 200.0,
          "end": 205.0,
          "text": "This is the second time it's happened in the stream. Third time, three strikes and you're out.\"",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081t7t7k0",
          "start": 206.08,
          "end": 209.32,
          "text": "Alright, I really don't want to have to be the one to do this, but...",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081qbwpjt",
          "start": 210.76,
          "end": 216.6,
          "text": "How can I, how can I enjoy the dialogue and reading the subtitles if there's spelling errors?",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081dttr7f",
          "start": 216.84,
          "end": 217.92,
          "text": "I can't do this, man.",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081h2x65e",
          "start": 230.12,
          "end": 234.56,
          "text": "You're not allowed to leave this room, your room, until you do your homework. You hear me, young lady?",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081z12kk0",
          "start": 245.6,
          "end": 247.88,
          "text": "Uh, there's kind of a story almost like that",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081fx8nwa",
          "start": 248.44,
          "end": 251.76,
          "text": "in, uh, in Natlan, actually, so you're not far off.",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081pb54xx",
          "start": 254.44,
          "end": 254.94,
          "text": "Uh!",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081sriy8r",
          "start": 255.36,
          "end": 255.86,
          "text": "Damn.",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081zmpe4a",
          "start": 259.6,
          "end": 261.0,
          "text": "We are the moon.",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081fthfxv",
          "start": 262.8,
          "end": 263.44,
          "text": "Aw.",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081t1yej0",
          "start": 264.56,
          "end": 267.27,
          "text": "Sisters being sisters, I love their energy.",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081y1j2bu",
          "start": 267.76,
          "end": 270.76,
          "text": "They were so like, formal and like...",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w0819ik67q",
          "start": 271.88,
          "end": 274.52,
          "text": "Official and proper when we first met them.",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w0814s0fw8",
          "start": 274.8,
          "end": 278.2,
          "text": "So this is them just like bantering. They're like sisters bantering, so...",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081g07o8k",
          "start": 278.88,
          "end": 279.6,
          "text": "I love that.",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w0812144w5",
          "start": 283.88,
          "end": 284.52,
          "text": "Hell yeah.",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081ce75ul",
          "start": 286.12,
          "end": 287.92,
          "text": "Oh my god, oh, the Kohenke are here now!",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081vq63fq",
          "start": 288.27,
          "end": 289.16,
          "text": "Nice!",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081590sq3",
          "start": 289.88,
          "end": 292.64,
          "text": "Oh, this god ray, holy moly.",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081q7nkq9",
          "start": 295.2,
          "end": 296.48,
          "text": "What a vibe, dude.",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081gjj1yo",
          "start": 297.64,
          "end": 299.0,
          "text": "We're all the way over here.",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w0811kgyjn",
          "start": 299.36,
          "end": 299.92,
          "text": "Chat!",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w0819pg806",
          "start": 301.06,
          "end": 302.43,
          "text": "I 100%ed it.",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w0818czj2m",
          "start": 303.15,
          "end": 307.23,
          "text": "We 100, we 100%ed the lunar highlands.",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081z7crlc",
          "start": 308.43,
          "end": 310.62,
          "text": "The moon is officially finished.",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w08167b33f",
          "start": 311.7,
          "end": 312.93,
          "text": "Absolute cinema.",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081hv0sg9",
          "start": 313.41,
          "end": 314.85,
          "text": "Massive W's.",
          "speaker": "S01",
          "character": "mob",
          "confidence": 0.0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "muu1w0811ed23u",
      "name": "Canon",
      "type": "asr",
      "track_role": "game",
      "scope": "output",
      "page": "",
      "video": "clip",
      "preview_visible": true,
      "events": [
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w0815tgxdr",
          "start": 8.788927456365375,
          "end": 16.28,
          "text": "You've been ditching work and sneaking out to play with humans more and more often these past few years, haven't you?",
          "speaker": "S02",
          "character": "Canon",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081n8u6jw",
          "start": 68.88,
          "end": 75.64,
          "text": "That was part of my duty.\nTheir high priest called my name.\nIt was only natural that I had to respond to their voices.",
          "speaker": "S02",
          "character": "Canon",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w0813ra54h",
          "start": 113.88,
          "end": 114.56,
          "text": "Aria.",
          "speaker": "S02",
          "character": "Canon",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081mm3b5z",
          "start": 121.8,
          "end": 129.24,
          "text": "I wasn't asking you to call my name.\nOh, forget it.\nSince the new moon envoy doesn't mind helping Sonnet with her work.",
          "speaker": "S02",
          "character": "Canon",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081e5nqg4",
          "start": 167.92,
          "end": 178.92,
          "text": "Since Zabai has no objections, I have nothing more to say.\nHowever, Sonnet, as the will of the moon, you must not forget the basic formula that keeps the world running.",
          "speaker": "S02",
          "character": "Canon",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081knw7ye",
          "start": 218.84,
          "end": 228.52,
          "text": "Prepare yourself.\nI will set you some foundational problems on verifying morphological isomorphisms.\nYou are not to go back to the surface until you have solved them all.",
          "speaker": "S02",
          "character": "Canon",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081laon3a",
          "start": 256.08,
          "end": 259.16,
          "text": "You are the moon. Don't say things like that.",
          "speaker": "S02",
          "character": "Canon",
          "confidence": 0.0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "muu1w082dmldqv",
      "name": "Sonnet",
      "type": "asr",
      "track_role": "game",
      "scope": "output",
      "page": "",
      "video": "clip",
      "preview_visible": true,
      "events": [
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081jsu0wo",
          "start": 20.64,
          "end": 27.12,
          "text": "What's the big deal? We can just leave the work to those moon envoys anyway, right?",
          "speaker": "S03",
          "character": "Sonnet",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081q37oa0",
          "start": 34.15,
          "end": 42.76,
          "text": "You've taken a shine to our new master's sisters.\nAnd they're willing to send subordinates to share our work.\nSo what choice do I have but to accept?",
          "speaker": "S03",
          "character": "Sonnet",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w0818dd2iz",
          "start": 56.76,
          "end": 64.48,
          "text": "Besides, you've been having a great time playing around too, Canon.\nYou even participated in a human festival.",
          "speaker": "S03",
          "character": "Sonnet",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w0819t9z0r",
          "start": 252.32,
          "end": 253.52,
          "text": "What she said.",
          "speaker": "S03",
          "character": "Sonnet",
          "confidence": 0.0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "muu1w082vrg8a4",
      "name": "Aria",
      "type": "asr",
      "track_role": "game",
      "scope": "output",
      "page": "",
      "video": "clip",
      "preview_visible": true,
      "events": [
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w0817u9tde",
          "start": 96.32,
          "end": 104.6,
          "text": "Is pretending to be an ordinary human girl and dancing in front of your own statue also one of your duties?\nThat's news to me.",
          "speaker": "S04",
          "character": "Aria",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w0811uo1km",
          "start": 118.08,
          "end": 118.68,
          "text": "Canon.",
          "speaker": "S02",
          "character": "Aria",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081yy1plw",
          "start": 135.56,
          "end": 140.91,
          "text": "Zabai.\nHer name is Zabai.\nYou really should remember people's names.",
          "speaker": "S04",
          "character": "Aria",
          "confidence": 0.0
        },
        {
          "type": "asr",
          "id": "muu1w081cse76l",
          "start": 236.96,
          "end": 243.52,
          "text": "How mean.\nYou're just like a villain from an earthbound novel, trying to drag the runaway princess back to the moon.",
          "speaker": "S04",
          "character": "Aria",
          "confidence": 0.0
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "created_at": "1788965429",
  "updated_at": "1791132507"
}
